OL,4,G2300F6 Music Artist in Residence
OL,5,     G6 Music's Artist In Residence is
OL,6,     Ga journey into the musical soul
OL,7,     Gof an artist, based around a
OL,8,     Gtheme or mood. The Voidz frontman
OL,9,     GJulian Casablancas shares his
OL,10,     Gmusical world.
OL,11,G0000F6 Music's Indie Forever
OL,12,     GNathan plays the best indie from
OL,13,     Gthe North East, with music by Sam
OL,14,     GFender & Futureheads!
OL,15,G0100FThe Atlantic Records Story
OL,16,     GJohnnie Walker looks at the early
OL,17,     Gdays of Atlantic Records,
OL,18,     Gexploring how the company was set
OL,19,     Gup and how it became home to some
OL,20,     Gof the world's greatest soul
OL,21,     Gsingers.
